# Retired local ticket queue — superseded by the maintaining team's tracker.
# The `kizen feedback` command is gone; this only keeps historical local
# tickets out of git status.
.feedback/

# Retired decision log. The `kizen log` command is gone — record-keeping is
# the user's workflow to choose, not something the CLI imposes. Existing
# decisions.md files are left on disk as plain markdown; this keeps them out
# of git status.
.kizen/decisions.md

